WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:11.981
"Let's make a snowman!" Emmy said.

2
00:00:11.982 --> 00:00:18.056
She made a big snowball.

3
00:00:18.057 --> 00:00:24.523
Harry put another snowball on top.

4
00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:29.958
Oliver tried to make the snowman's head.

5
00:00:29.959 --> 00:00:38.884
But he was too small.

6
00:00:38.885 --> 00:00:44.398
Harry made eyes for the snowman.

7
00:00:44.399 --> 00:00:49.952
Emmy made a nose for the snowman.

8
00:00:49.953 --> 00:00:54.641
Oliver tried to make a mouth.

9
00:00:54.642 --> 00:01:01.213
But he was too small.

10
00:01:01.214 --> 00:01:05.820
Oliver looked sad.

11
00:01:05.821 --> 00:01:09.415
"You can find a hat," Harry said.

12
00:01:09.416 --> 00:01:11.868
Emmy nodded.

13
00:01:11.869 --> 00:01:17.721
"Find a silly hat for the snowman!"

14
00:01:17.722 --> 00:01:22.731
Oliver got a soup pot.

15
00:01:22.732 --> 00:01:28.675
"This could be a silly hat," he said.

16
00:01:28.676 --> 00:01:34.014
Harry put it on the snowman.

17
00:01:34.015 --> 00:01:40.642
"Nope," Harry said.

18
00:01:40.643 --> 00:01:44.018
Oliver got a box.

19
00:01:44.019 --> 00:01:49.065
"This could be a silly hat!" he said.

20
00:01:49.066 --> 00:01:54.914
Emmy put it on the snowman.

21
00:01:54.915 --> 00:02:03.020
"It's not right either," she said.

22
00:02:03.021 --> 00:02:06.926
Oliver got a scarf.

23
00:02:06.927 --> 00:02:11.036
"What about this?" he asked.

24
00:02:11.037 --> 00:02:19.323
Harry put the scarf on the snowman's head.

25
00:02:19.324 --> 00:02:24.538
Emmy shook her head again.

26
00:02:24.539 --> 00:02:29.957
"I know!" Oliver cried.

27
00:02:29.958 --> 00:02:34.481
He took the soup pot, and the box, and the scarf.

28
00:02:34.482 --> 00:02:36.839
He got some tape.

29
00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:40.464
He made a new hat.

30
00:02:40.465 --> 00:02:45.453
Harry put the hat on the snowman.

31
00:02:45.454 --> 00:02:51.797
Everyone laughed.

32
00:02:51.798 --> 00:02:57.234
"Now the snowman looks very silly!" Emmy said.

33
00:02:57.235 --> 00:03:00.367
Oliver grinned.

34
00:03:00.368 --> 00:03:03.533
"I'm small," he said.

35
00:03:03.534 --> 00:03:11.267
"But I have big ideas!"

